{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1243,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:740349c78b9b6c5e88ac4d9d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "重炮对这套服装赞不绝口……\r\n虽然我不太懂，但她说\r\n就像音速战斗机一样。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4988142ca76c6dc78d0037f2b4ceeb3677375790eaa7849671a928fece8a4a83",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1016",
        "91018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0442c4ead45932a8aea5526b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "鲁道夫垂着尾巴听气槽说教……\r\n只要不被波及，\r\n那场面实在是很有趣。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d7848e5e0a6c4c3c23dab58279adf99c1889445950167072776beea58e72ee36",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1016",
        "91019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2d871203d12a60b5c8bba32a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大姐刚开始戴眼镜时，\r\n我因为新奇曾经偷偷拿来戴过……\r\n但一戴上就头晕了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "22e74a0ac5029b7c7d2457e83d4405dbcdc79fb8f3bf1a2bc4c675dc02dbbfd5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1016",
        "91020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aecc86cf89690ed9916efb45",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我正要吃饭时，发现桌上\r\n放着一杯果菜汁……\r\n大姐那家伙，竟然多管闲事……",
      "source_fingerprint": "38ae6287c224934ee6a4151f3e381626364f3e04ea589524d92d2ac85d79f3b6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1016",
        "91021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:055c970972fad32dd6751dee",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会吃肉以外的食物，\r\n但都不如吃肉能补充力气，\r\n所以我选择吃肉。有意见吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "f80b488d21eb73bf967a9fa4fdb3cac81f527a1a2fddf89c8db214ac562d1019",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1016",
        "91022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:df6342f2de4eb5f96a03078e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "原来晚上练耐力跑这么舒畅啊。\r\n要是早点知道就好了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "117e13113c0c9d0792689dc9b7900eb75ef0dcbe3403583fdb6d42c7c02b96fb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1016",
        "91023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b623af95f3aa2e04b642cdee",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "亚马约我去赏花。我们一起吃了\r\n两个四层便当……美味是美味，\r\n但她也做太多料理了吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7e2d10bde7976c62b8fdb60209d666f785e7e5a7f6b8c745676482b3d8c88c44",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1016",
        "91024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1a863ae3eb9a9c4020a87459",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在我家，麦茶是夏天的必备饮料。\r\n我负责喝光，大姐负责泡。\r\n……偶尔也会换我泡喔。只是偶尔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "903d8de1b99145c182ebd2a8e8b22fd16152450b7083f9bf5e308713e78c0833",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1016",
        "91025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:789dd0e645b2ff144626febc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "骏大祭的流镝马……真的很不错。\r\n在伸手不见五指的黑暗中，\r\n所有感官逐渐打开的感觉……呵。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4d48915e47c3fee8295764fbe0e4857528bacd9fc43ae909c4bf1bb60dc29c9f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1016",
        "91026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1e46c0b8971984119d9acaec",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下雪的季节吗。\r\n我也曾经看着雪白的景色看到入迷，\r\n那毫无阴影、纯白无瑕的景色……",
      "source_fingerprint": "be5dc22d6d2c91f03ec307021e21b959f5577d7646d29788a9aaeb89bc6092d1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1016",
        "91027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:026e8ffa9146021059e9a79c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "光与影、荣耀与挫折。\r\n体验过二者，仍然敢于挑战胜负──\r\n这套衣服，就象征着这样的意志。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6e4de044c1b73d1155de5aa86fa06eec2e3eb502b11310931e09b540af6b8f15",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1016",
        "91028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8af7621d81a82e5b355f99b0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然这套服装宛如黑暗……\r\n但穿上它的我却感到斗志熊熊燃烧。\r\n化身夺走胜利的黑影──也不错。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5367040234801bbe32f7890e2e6c9b51c122e509e3a8db8762f4648f30fc2573",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1016",
        "91029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d149f1fd00a10fe8f8bc035e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "取胜是需要实力的。\r\n……开始吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b3db90d680877b257dbda6c9ed4802c876be94637071abb852c3875d55ade02b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1016",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:25f3506102b187b5061dbb77",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "行くぞ……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "40503d4efeaedddf3221ed890a8c38071d33db21f8ff9edfd07c8ce195434d6b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1016",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d3a8f0ea203c4eae8e19a4e8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "让我见识看看你的作法吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2ea0d243c74eff16f8a5f31415fc7e236b74216eb8c80d4fc79c9ff8ce73c76e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1016",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c8e9bf0e7e7238d1288efd1e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大意失荆州。\r\n……专心面对吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2b741fcb22d7dad9b794542eba01666d57f11fbc64af5b46ae4f76254158e1cc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1016",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cfa0b6ec97f185f1a347ffc4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "现在的努力都是为了应战做准备……\r\n可没有时间浪费。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cb42c2e1052427ca39c8d6236c8645f89582c2bb5571c2c7adc61219f046121b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1016",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3900d60cc59ed79369a2513d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在失去翅膀之前，鸟都会持续飞翔。\r\n只为飞得更高、更远……",
      "source_fingerprint": "572b1eaad1f0c3ba3795742629212fef1e224231a0ce013272171699c4d82217",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1016",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:77abccf38ae710a6a0bb066d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "变得越强就会越看不到极限。\r\n……但现在我只需要专注全力冲刺。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d2176da2d4679c1cbc29d876eb45274d2b2ab72b971a899919ad505bf56a2db2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1016",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0257a58fdd386518a9d324ed",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "能力越强大，欲望也会跟着膨胀……\r\n──赶快开始我们的训练吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "47a297d6118a1d105d7ceb8e6fd0bc0fb15ee95dadfcec94a0d9a04340430392",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1016",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7718791591da5b61b4f9ee71",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……随便的锻炼是不可能\r\n在比赛中派上用场的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "52ab3a36bed0b9b408c97c5b6d1023f8f66a50f2cbf4fe24d6c04cebc947f222",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1016",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9aea945be219f0931f3ed517",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "开始吧。我早就准备好了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e13937ce0fb5828b9392ff572a35e519e68a487d2d991475ab9dd09dfa405908",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1016",
        "92015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ce5659520527037bd8a8acfa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "每当我训练得越多，\r\n期待上场比赛的心情就越强烈。\r\n来吧，我还要变得更亢奋……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d737a3b6882eca563bed5f7b65ebd41a29df3b33260f3310718d81434a89e878",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1016",
        "92016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aaf221ed7e472b2fbae160a4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不用顾虑我。\r\n什么指示我都能达成。\r\n尽管来吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "81d5f5ecc7a488d1e1e6b9a5e33e4b91ba671197d446da6327c0013c1599acb3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1016",
        "92017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:526cca354303d063d2a19779",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我看到你放在桌上的\r\n那份训练项目了。\r\n……就照那样没问题。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5909a08b229fd5e2a9d86cfccab5699cd0a74fdc5b75d924cca488ea3f05bdbe",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1016",
        "92018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:935ad3b550cb7f0e22ebde56",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "怪物就该有怪物的样子，\r\n将一切啃食殆尽。为此，\r\n现在我得先将尖牙磨利……对吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "3165f412bd4a2184ec698399bb63a568d96b9fa873e02bde54459d77c68ced7f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1016",
        "92020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0d023c4dab9446447fa99680",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "热身时我尽量收敛了……毕竟\r\n我可不想糟蹋你安排的训练项目。\r\n那，我该做什么？",
      "source_fingerprint": "8be09634443cf9778851bc770428ace8ab8c3b752b1c256b2b2d334c573f2d37",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1016",
        "92021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5be60224ba0d3b7190c843b7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "直到最后，对手们甚至连我的影子\r\n都踩不到……我会跑出像这样\r\n有着绝对差距的比赛给你看的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c5db7d1d6c9cbe34b572bf0ac9c70961b143b19eeece3985390de148ef2d4fcc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1016",
        "92022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:914b9185ba333c532812b737",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……我们现在的眼神都很不错呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d2734b6def8e5d0ca3a8b26beb3cf144b61d379ebeae31fb1279dd23da35b300",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1016",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6b0170d2306174a5c5fa773e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的欲望……稍微得到满足了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8e19f80419d4fc4b6427ea8e6e81d25d725575d3ae501f08ba5c71dbec0b7355",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1016",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:72223f1096aa6293ecf9a255",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我只说一次……今后也要跟上我。",
      "source_fingerprint": "04732cdb9efba79aa2d378e64be3f3255209d90469c3867de4117c352cb7b1cc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1016",
        "93004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e3cfd40cddb50b303f20b139",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你的决心还不赖嘛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f4825991ee90ff4dfab981662421de4ec5ae721da94569398de4a139e8a3aafa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1016",
        "93005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4e6c3a5ad97682f5305595b6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我需要……更强大的实力……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ef9c11a5426ffe671288ad3d11c5c01caf271f82fad5ff8c748afa4a93b945b1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1016",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5e90b65cea57cb8d851d863c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "还要更好、再更好……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8ae22bda14777360206984db03156536fbc88bb81ee7b16ab91677ba51e4553c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1016",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c306cd9561e9dc90f8671d33",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……没错，我就是成田白仁。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a66cd913ef08dabd4cd2601ebb63e76ae689405e9c8a3b70bd9f30542ec8d6ae",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1016",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e77a0d04c0c617e6712182a7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会继续奋斗──\r\n只要灵魂还在沸腾、\r\n内心还在吶喊……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "de1c082bcd9410db7e22a851416f39c1ef5ad4bc852e1776a20bde2a0bcf5170",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1016",
        "95004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7fa812d3418eae64cdad90d8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……我来帮你一把。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f9ea25a57ca1cc758459bef65da0df48cc90b4f8681f000fb23177a255f1c596",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1016",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:87cf977d1b49fc05a040c026",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我来让你超越极限……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9c6646e561f162f849acba44debd33e8507c48251478cdebda76a0ea0b00d268",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1016",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ac95d1bb3a1910b8075093dd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵，我开始热血沸腾了……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "27203c977f7f48a42e5ae7684089445f0f566b4b8da6c8e978351c183a93284f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1016",
        "95007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8547d23ef69bb4676134e44a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "看我彻底突破极限……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d7728540d9db13bf2620be37c88ca939a5ea504f9e7c72bb3bac67b631c085d7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1016",
        "95008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5bf4a3e87725337f8105fd6f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "磨利尖牙及利爪──\r\n将对方的咽喉，紧咬不放！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d43ffcf9f17f826f82794837133cfcd1e403d1f6cfc9cfd4127aa49bb3cbc92e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1016",
        "95009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eb1879c76e96bc744c56b224",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是成田白仁。做好觉悟了吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "f9ab463627ba63a4d414e957d01c5b7f53a10c31c3a314ae944c6826a8546fb1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1016",
        "95010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:94c928c2add529b183e9df96",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我们团结一致地去完成吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "978b5bb93c2a978f8835c9b34e3e1982c43215d7fbe5693e8c9129031bd0ebf4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:326369f8e41c92f956652a14",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你已有觉悟和我一起\r\n朝共同志向迈进，\r\n我就得拿出不辜负于你的成果呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d65eb7cd750d9e7d96803e6e9cc56a46d0cab409fe2e7ea0f3c247c3ff3f8517",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fcab14c05d11d53e4272e73a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "行ってくる。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5c258c6fbb37905535703e68e2fc288861a7a636980f7eab0cb36dd332608f75",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:867ac07ae7b664df13f211a2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ただいま戻った。",
      "source_fingerprint": "809c344db5c628d87546acdce913a8c26b391e0d2fbb431c8b0b8ab477a20ac2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:079d71040dde142f4a696fb0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一直被我视为妄想的「顶点」──\r\n因为有你的陪伴与协助，\r\n才让我感觉正在一步步接近它。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dfeb668c927def35da5845ef4f0ce4f4410911f363d06f397ebf4462269913d8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:893164c5da842c0c88aab1a0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "站在别人的立场去思考，\r\n就能发现到原本没发现的观点……\r\n这是你教会我的哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "713fc291d5729da96dc3db7acd523209cdb1fb539e9fe141c24da3815a5d452b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c0a805b337caa00a9719cb19",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "新年快乐。\r\n今年我们也要同心协力一起努力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "adf4cb8c8d0c913ea0a6256442de3460784394f57f6a143a93d2c531d5812b3d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4ec311d3334df5bc4e3bea30",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有学生把巧克力送来学生会办公室。\r\n感恩戴德──我会用心做好我在\r\n学生会的职务，来报答这份恩情。",
      "source_fingerprint": "df73f3569ceadfb63f9d27e4b104e605d3665c7403831c2ecbaf3d619c356c09",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c8822b93c495ddc97f0a4445",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我做了巧克力，你收下吧。\r\n里面只加一点点糖，是为了表达\r\n我们挑战的道路上不会只有甜头。",
      "source_fingerprint": "870fea8d8e5b5dd45c42dbcdd07dbee54a890d99207ea458d197ac792f99aab2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eddf7260d15370200b1e33b3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "把对学生会的意见写在签纸上的\r\n七夕活动似乎颇受好评。\r\n我会尽力实现大家的愿望的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "92440d769d78eb0220ba544e43b01e4aa100cb7b27a3328796ecb0297c4b3984",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b45d0d3f6fb6ac62dbe51c8f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "万圣节快乐。到处都听到\r\n有学生在感叹吃了太多点心，\r\n希望你不会这样。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9ac21dceaaae99adf7e972dca94f1e46af71b18afe25a56562765a08b4391808",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9f8555b6d83e6c5001085f45",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "圣诞快乐，训练员君。\r\n虽然今天还要忙学生会主办的活动，\r\n但也要尽情享受节日的气氛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "74c4215baf4712bd9b146ff9287069356bcab93218ee5cf87bca369f3c6fc360",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f6693399d1b0d3497548e4ae",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "中庭的树好像没有后辈去装饰……\r\n怎么样？跟我一起去巡视兼散步如何？",
      "source_fingerprint": "95e7cc22f585035bcc7a5eb05e91daa1f341f13fafc36a3ceb732ae52b4f6d19",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:76277e04c96ab603efc98ae1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "各位都做得很好。",
      "source_fingerprint": "eb54f2263d66aaf1c538c367a247dd0fd9cb1072adbf6a3ddfd309f35fd9f5e5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ef28aa5324789502ea730655",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一转眼就过完了这充实的一年。\r\n明年我们也要一起进步成长。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8d0daa1c8deb86139059916474047f4ee571a8d54af6eb65d1f21d919b5876fb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ba7bb66729a69bfe6297e819",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天是你的生日吧。\r\n训练结束后来办个小小的庆生会吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5a663e3648ea9ff37cd37b3ebc6ef419e631f41c62932f9488b4259cc50b1e0b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c576fb20ecff063520d64343",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "生日快乐，训练员君。\r\n身为拥有共同志向的同伴，\r\n我要比谁都更积极庆祝你的生日。",
      "source_fingerprint": "86a33b1ac84e7618d0be2e63fbcca454a4e4a0eee6733792974f9044f44653a0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1843cc72a0c2af068865d00b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不只是收到学生和学生会伙伴，\r\n还能收到你的祝福……\r\n真是大喜过望。",
      "source_fingerprint": "83da3a72414153a3a52055471210b4603fc49893f1f935389494f3397cec0ef9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:46378a3054b0f506776b1938",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你是特地亲自前来祝我\r\n生日快乐的吗……\r\n庆祝……亲祝……呵呵呵呵……",
      "source_fingerprint": "dfb235c3eae6724adc7329453ec6f1404d0be19adfc9c5860319fa47ca7a6117",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:15bb422f22a6c7bfdafb46cf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "收到新公告了。\r\n说不定是什么重要的事情，\r\n确认一下吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fe3ef08fd4af001c45dda89147d7bac01cc5bae48695c0c33c579e987c72cd1c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:13c5a216a4e9f2fea871ffaf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "收到礼物了。\r\n呵呵，我也很期待看看是什么东西。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b9793d11e98734cf3e84d798ef5c2dd4e524c83173d7bf167540043280d5e76e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:20256957008b5e65e9dc14a7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "任务达成了。\r\n如同身经百战这句话，\r\n丰富的经验是会使人成长的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c5decf5f34cc8182bc22854a02fd5edc1ae85b35b04debbf0902b91af38a8233",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:70ba841e8cbb7cca6e4fef72",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像快要有活动了。\r\n做好万全的准备再去挑战吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d654842e16ac15fd41fd908ee66ddc106aca708cd54c66152b644dda9616c319",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:799d22a66267d4bddccd4735",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动开始了，\r\n我们一起朝目标勇往直前吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f319d6de5d7c3f2b054441c6ddd3a46b1c812c5c5e7743725d4cf1b27f54e08f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b94b73e610b9cf5e60401703",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "反败为胜，下次还有机会。",
      "source_fingerprint": "34dafe736bf4c16861abb62bcde816c70b4ce25e8bc0dcf584ffacd834d0ed94",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7e1bffe1845189be0a5077f0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哦，名册的等级提升了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f1da24f83cd748d9a2ad301118e91db889651dd462054da7e448b2792e7a8cc4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "10021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:599e196dff290b29adf0ff57",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我戴的算是平光眼镜。\r\n用意是告诫自己也要留意\r\n一些平时容易忽视掉的地方。",
      "source_fingerprint": "07713d7be9b14bb6a074b4a11fa5dc7c8c0bcf8211a557d90b80a0a41b21516f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "10025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:49eb27f46692ac7819b0862a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这套衣服使我更常被误以为是\r\n成年人……不过也能让我注意到\r\n社会人士应有的举止，还不错。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cc325961545965516af55dc9f8e6dcd38fa00d0e86e8e7e17a2a0049cf49eb8c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "10026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e69cb7738478b6a2628b0eea",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会放进包包里的东西……\r\n第一个就是笔记本。亲手写下\r\n冷笑话题材还是比较棒。",
      "source_fingerprint": "08583c102b05cccff9688f1da30a556df3a9a08a0b76b964df7d4e7f762cb7df",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "10027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2aa762e282c2216b56f2c70f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真是可敬的对手。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7cf106fe21fa40d86f5d5ed8de281f9ef2c43131c0f9938512787303a81e2c78",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "1003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b6c883da8ed945daf30ce0ed",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "荣耀是属于我们的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2809b3e93db801511373e012356d0a96e6a7bd9216ebb55f2d2d07fb6605de6a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "1004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:beb4338a5eb1478f1c925d68",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "反败为胜，下次还有机会。",
      "source_fingerprint": "34dafe736bf4c16861abb62bcde816c70b4ce25e8bc0dcf584ffacd834d0ed94",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "1005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:175ae0d50d477564cf765398",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真是可敬的对手。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7cf106fe21fa40d86f5d5ed8de281f9ef2c43131c0f9938512787303a81e2c78",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "1006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9f7ef74debc2a08e0f415044",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最高分更新了，真是值得高兴。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e4076f2d76e942c92a4cc316ec2eedec2ad988fabefc533fb089e31d6553a344",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "1007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:46cb1f3ad74cdf0bd8289831",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "奋力一搏，打起精神上吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "dd6027b99b7f877246512aa7b03b92a44c7990d01b0c1b739633afd56e6424fa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "1008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3b2ebad04633a17c37c8a246",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我们上，帝王。",
      "source_fingerprint": "98b8a3f64716b8021884c1e164434dc69b2b5754e0615e1b3fb0a9d26d6cfa8d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "1013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1f1bd717074187d67110459e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好，走吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f6b1ef5593a4e5ff1facc80d4025d0d09989674f2a2a5cc52f5a1e732997d9fd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "1041"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ba35ae6a141b0f6f4dc7fc36",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我很期待。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fb68552f124570bd5245c78bdd75a028b4df21ce5b7bd41549967729dbf58354",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "1042"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
